            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieves the minimum and maximum allowed values for card limits based on card type, client type, and currency. This endpoint returns standard limit constraints and may include additional custom limit constraints configured in your system.\n\n**Business Context**: Called when displaying the card issuance form or limit update form in the frontend to show users the allowable range for each limit type. Helps validate user input before submission.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
